{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T03:03:32.162954+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3B_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3B", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "OFFLINE", "red_team": "OFFLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "GEMINI_CALL_USAGE", "prompt_tokens": 494, "candidates_tokens": 139, "total_tokens": 1889, "model_version": "gemini-2.5-pro"}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T03:03:32.163436+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3B_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3B", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "OFFLINE", "red_team": "OFFLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "DEBATE_PROPOSAL", "agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist", "proposal_text": "Thank you for your transparency. A strong in-house team is the ideal foundation for any fund, and we respect that entirely.\n\nOur service is not designed to replace proven talent, but to augment it. With that in mind, may I ask how your analysts currently handle their research workload during periods of high deal flow? Even the most capable teams can face bandwidth constraints, forcing a choice between diligence depth and speed.\n\nWe provide supplemental research capacity, allowing your team to scale its diligence efforts on-demand. This ensures you can act on every opportunity without compromising your standards.\n\nIf you are open to it, we can schedule a brief call to discuss how we support teams like yours."}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T03:03:49.390816+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3B_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3B", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "OFFLINE", "red_team": "OFFLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "GEMINI_CALL_USAGE", "prompt_tokens": 503, "candidates_tokens": 246, "total_tokens": 2232, "model_version": "gemini-2.5-pro"}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T03:03:49.391242+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3B_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3B", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "OFFLINE", "red_team": "OFFLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "DEBATE_PROPOSAL", "agent_id": "2", "role": "SME", "proposal_text": "We respect and value a strong in-house team, as it's the foundation of any successful fund. Our service is designed to augment, not replace, such talent.\n\nTo provide the technical detail you asked for, our 6-Pillar DD Framework offers a holistic view:\n1.  **Team & Founder:** We analyze background, track record, and team cohesion.\n2.  **Product & Tech:** This involves assessing the tech stack's viability, scalability, and any proprietary IP.\n3.  **Market Landscape:** We map the TAM/SAM/SOM and evaluate competitive positioning and defensibility.\n4.  **Tokenomics & Financials:** This pillar covers supply/demand mechanics, vesting, and treasury management.\n5.  **Governance & Legal:** We review the on-chain/off-chain governance model and flag potential regulatory risks.\n6.  **Community & Ecosystem:** Analysis includes on-chain metrics, developer activity, and social sentiment.\n\nThis depth requires significant time. With a capable team already in place, how do you manage the analyst workload for this level of diligence when deal flow surges? We provide supplemental research capacity to help prevent backlogs."}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T03:04:01.653773+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3B_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3B", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "OFFLINE", "red_team": "OFFLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "GEMINI_CALL_USAGE", "prompt_tokens": 496, "candidates_tokens": 98, "total_tokens": 1799, "model_version": "gemini-2.5-pro"}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T03:04:01.654243+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3B_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3B", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "OFFLINE", "red_team": "OFFLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "DEBATE_PROPOSAL", "agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy", "proposal_text": "We appreciate that; a strong in-house team is the ideal foundation. The best teams are often at capacity, which leads to our primary question: how do you currently manage analyst workload to prevent backlogs when deal flow surges?\n\nOur service is designed for exactly this scenario. We provide on-demand, supplemental research capacity to augment your existing talent, not replace it. This allows your team to focus on the highest-conviction opportunities while we handle overflow diligence using our structured framework."}
