{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T03:05:20.495993+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3B_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3B", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "OFFLINE", "red_team": "OFFLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "DEBATE_PROPOSAL", "agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist", "proposal_text": "You've articulated the core issue precisely. The primary operational problem we solve is analyst bandwidth constraints impacting existing deal flow. Our service provides skilled, on-demand supplemental research capacity, allowing your in-house team to manage overflow and screen a wider range of opportunities without sacrificing analytical rigor. This frees your core analysts to concentrate on the most promising late-stage evaluations rather than preliminary diligence. With that in mind, how does your team currently manage its research backlog when deal flow exceeds immediate analytical capacity?"}
