{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T03:05:38.184528+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3B_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3B", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "OFFLINE", "red_team": "OFFLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "DEBATE_PROPOSAL", "agent_id": "2", "role": "SME", "proposal_text": "You've pinpointed the core issue. We primarily address analyst bandwidth constraints. The operational problem is the time cost of conducting rigorous, multi-faceted diligence on every potential deal.\n\nFor instance, our technical analysis involves not just whitepaper review, but static code analysis of the main repo, assessing developer commit velocity, and stress-testing smart contracts on a testnet. Our tokenomics modeling projects vesting unlocks against potential exchange liquidity to forecast major sell-pressure risks. This depth is resource-intensive. We provide the supplemental research capacity for this exhaustive work, freeing your team to focus on final-stage conviction and portfolio construction rather than top-of-funnel deep dives.\n\nGiven the current market pace, are your analysts ever forced to pass on a complex but promising project simply due to a lack of time for this level of deep-dive verification?"}
