{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T03:05:57.640937+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3B_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3B", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "OFFLINE", "red_team": "OFFLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "DEBATE_PROPOSAL", "agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy", "proposal_text": "You've precisely identified our core value: we solve for analyst bandwidth constraints on existing deal flow. Our service provides on-demand, supplemental research capacity, allowing your team to offload time-intensive, preliminary screening. This ensures your senior analysts can focus their expertise on final-stage diligence and high-conviction decisions, rather than being stretched thin by a growing pipeline. We handle the overflow so your top talent can concentrate on the most critical opportunities without sacrificing coverage.\n\nGiven this, when deal flow surges, do you find that otherwise promising assets are often backlogged simply due to a lack of immediate analyst availability?"}
