{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T03:07:51.544416+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3B_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3B", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "OFFLINE", "red_team": "OFFLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "DEBATE_PROPOSAL", "agent_id": "2", "role": "SME", "proposal_text": "Excellent questions. Methodological rigor is core to our value.\n\n1.  **Commit Velocity:** We use a weighted commit scoring model that normalizes for code churn and project stage (e.g., pre- vs. post-launch). This distinguishes meaningful development from raw activity or minor refactoring.\n\n2.  **Data Pipeline:** Our process relies on authenticated API polling for real-time data. To ensure accuracy, we combine this with anomaly detection models specifically trained to filter out bot activity and identify genuine human contributor patterns.\n\n3.  **Stress Testing:** We simulate a range of attack vectors, focusing on high-impact exploits like reentrancy patterns and flash loans. We then weight findings by a matrix of exploit probability and estimated financial impact under mainnet conditions.\n\nOur goal is to automate this intensive analysis, providing the overflow capacity to ensure you never pass on a deal due to bandwidth. Is this level of granular, code-level verification currently a manual bottleneck for your team?"}
